WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.260
I'm going to show you how you can set up the environment.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.540
So after you get, just to give you,

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:13.540
after you get your API key, which is right here,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.340
you go to the keys panel in Colab,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.920
you paste the value right here

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.300
and make sure to name it LUMEN_API_KEY, the same as here,

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.700
as the notebook reads this, and make sure this is turned on.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.100
If you don't have it, just click add new secret,

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:39.660
paste the key, name it LUMEN_API_KEY, turn it on,

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.780
should be good to go.
